Taft -> DexterSouthfield[label="16.2
04/25", weight="84", tooltip="NEIRA Boys Fours, Pomfret v. Dexter-Southfield, Groton, Taft			
Distance: 1500M Conditions: Very light tailwind, 3 to 6 MPH. Water: flat or slight ripple. Great conditions. Comments: Note: Pomfret raced down; Pomfret results should not be considered for NEIRA Seeding.
Races alternated with girls. Order of boys races: B4, B2, B3, B1, B5. 
In the B2 event, D-S drifted slightly into Taft's lane, and Taft drifted slightly into Groton's lane during the first 500. No boat appeared to be impeded; no blades touched. No protest registered.
Great conditions, some close racing. Thanks to D-S, Groton, and Taft for making the trip.
